
### 1. Register
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

### 2. Login
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

### 3. Login (named so later requests can reuse the token)
#̥ @name customerLogin
POST̥ http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

### 4. Who am I?
̥̥GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 5. Customer tries admin route (should FAIL with 403)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin.response.body.token}}

### 6. Admin login
# @name adminLogin
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@infy.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### 7. Admin uses admin route (should WORK)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/ping
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin.response.body.token}}

### 8. No token (should FAIL with 401)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/auth/me

### P1. List all products
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products

### P2. Search for "nova"
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?search=nova

### P3. Price between 20000 and 60000
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?minPrice=20000&maxPrice=60000

### P4. Only the Smartphones main category (includes both subcategories)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?category=1

### P5. Cheapest first, in stock only
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?sort=price_asc&inStock=true

### P6. Page 2 with 3 per page
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products?page=2&limit=3

### P7. One product
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products/1

### P8. Bad id (should be 400)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/products/abc

### P9. Category tree
GET http://localhost:5000/api/categories

### P10. Register again (the reset deleted the old test user)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Test User",
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

### P11. Customer login
# @name customerLogin2
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "Test@1234"
}

### P12. Customer posts a review
POST http://localhost:5000/api/products/1/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin2.response.body.token}}

{
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Excellent camera and battery."
}

### P13. Customer tries to create a product (should be 403)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin2.response.body.token}}

{
  "name": "Hack Phone",
  "description": "Customers must not be able to add this.",
  "price": 100,
  "imageUrl": "https://placehold.co/400x400",
  "categoryId": 2
}

### P14. Admin login
# @name adminLogin2
POST http://localhost:5000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@infy.com",
  "password": "Admin@123"
}

### P15. Admin creates a product
# @name newProduct
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin2.response.body.token}}

{
  "name": "Test Phone",
  "description": "A phone created from the admin API.",
  "price": 15999,
  "discount": 5,
  "stock": 3,
  "imageUrl": "https://placehold.co/400x400?text=Test",
  "specs": { "RAM": "6GB", "Storage": "64GB" },
  "categoryId": 2
}

### P16. Admin updates price and stock
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/admin/products/{{newProduct.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin2.response.body.token}}

{
  "price": 14999,
  "stock": 50
}

### P17. Admin sends invalid data (should be 400)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/admin/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin2.response.body.token}}

{
  "name": "X",
  "description": "short",
  "price": -5,
  "imageUrl": "javascript:alert(1)",
  "categoryId": 2
}

### P18. Admin deletes the test product
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/admin/products/{{newProduct.response.body.id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminLogin2.response.body.token}}



### Customer tries the admin dashboard (should be 403)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/admin/stats
Authorization: Bearer {{customerLogin2.response.body.token}}